<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Centocor Inc to strong buy from buy, calling recent weakness in the shares a buying opportunity.</p>
<p>-- Set one-year price target of $43 per share, based on 25 times 1998 earnings estimate of $1.70 per share; the 1997 estimate is $0.75 per share.</p>
<p>-- Cut fourth quarter earnings estimate to $0.04 per share from $0.08 because of lack of growth at Centocor's diagnostic business. However, said the diagnostic business does not represent an important part of the company's future.</p>
</text>
